  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 15117778944
    m_Localized: 'Click here

      to begin the

      practice'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 939412357120
    m_Localized: 'Welcome to the Space Station for Programming Training

      Look
      at each of the objects to learn what they do


      I''m Mark 2000, the Artificial
      Intelligence of Mark, the robot next to you.



      I''m having trouble controlling
      my body. Could you help me? When you''re ready, click the button in the center
      of the room

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2157576650752
    m_Localized: 'Programming cubes


      Put the cubes on the computer to program!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2784725762048
    m_Localized: The Reset button reloads the level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3514593378304
    m_Localized: Use the orange button to move the programming platform up or down
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3844492165120
    m_Localized: 'Hello! I''m Mark!


      The space station tutor!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4327080394752
    m_Localized: Use the green button to move in the level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20636665053184
    m_Localized: 'Click here

      to change

      languages'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19278344073183232
    m_Localized: 'Mark''s cumputer


      The cubes go along the programming board


      Like
      the Start cube!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 277376314453307392
    m_Localized: 'Click here

      to exit

      the game'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 383225046053167104
    m_Localized: The Clear button removes the blocks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 383225048699772928
    m_Localized: The Play button runs the algorithm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 335226677362880512
    m_Localized: 'Click here

      to disable

      the narrator'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 345558750640402432
    m_Localized: 'Click here

      to enable

      the narrator'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 463426941462179840
    m_Localized: 'Hello student! Welcome to the Space Station for Programming Training!


      To
      move, click on the green arrows scattered through the station.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 5238613545581019214
  - m_Id: 463426998148198400
    m_Localized: 'The green arrows indicate where you should go.


      Keep moving
      around to help me understand how humans explore their environment!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 463427057388548096
    m_Localized: "This is Mark, my robotic avatar.\nHe's fully functional, but we
      still have much to learn.\n\nThat's why we\xB4re collecting the data of your
      movement in here!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 463427092511649792
    m_Localized: Try making a simple program, completing the spaces on the computer
      with Start, Movement and End blocks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 463427124744876032
    m_Localized: 'Mark glitched right in front of the door!


      Make a program
      to move him away from the door, bringing him closer to the computer.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
